## 6. Query Invalidation Strategy

| Action | Invalidate | Rationale |
|--------|-----------|-----------|
| Create | `lists` (same type), `searches` | New entry affects list and search results |
| Update | `lists` (all), `searches` | Entry might change type |
| Delete | `lists` (all), `searches` | Remove from all cached queries |
| Compile | `compile`, `compileByType` | Update compile status |

